  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added axis-aligned Rectangle, OrientedRectangle, NormalizedSubrectangle, rectangle contour/region conversion, and rectangle-to-oriented conversion APIs. Split region contracts into IRegion and IContourBasedRegion, renamed Region to ContourBasedRegion, and renamed ParametricLine to ParameterizedLine. Hardened arc intersection/tolerance behavior and invariant-culture formatting. Expanded edge-case regression, seeded property/fuzz, and explicit stress coverage for curves, rectangles, regions, Voronoi partitioning, Poisson disk sampling, Delaunay culling, and rasterization. Added linear/circular curve documentation and reproducible local MkDocs setup. Breaking changes: Region is now ContourBasedRegion, ParametricLine is now ParameterizedLine, NormalizedRectanglePart is now NormalizedSubrectangle, and region contracts are split into IRegion/IContourBasedRegion.",
